"shows":{"p":"chips","does":"a counter beside the printer climbs to 20"},"do":[{"p":"chipStand","v":"show","w":"One"},{"p":"chips","v":"show","w":"One"},{"p":"chips","v":"count","w":"chip","d":1.4}],"shots":[{"focus":["printer","chips","puller"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"problem2","shows":{"p":"printer","does":"dark specks of dust drop onto the wafer under the beam"},"state":{"text":"DEAD CHIP","w":"kill"},"do":[{"p":"chips","v":"hide","w":"But"},{"p":"printer","v":"dust","w":"single"},{"p":"printer","v":"land","w":"dust"}],"shots":[{"focus":["printer","puller"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"problem3","shows":{"p":"mud","does":"rain pours and mud splatters onto the open machines"},"state":{"text":"BATCH RUINED","w":"ruins"},"do":[{"p":"light","v":"storm","w":"rain"},{"p":"rain","v":"start","w":"rain"},{"p":"mud","v":"fall","w":"mud"}],"shots":[{"focus":["puller","wafers","printer","mud"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"fix4","shows":{"p":"hall","does":"a factory hall rises round the machines and white arrows show clean air pushed down"},"do":[{"p":"light","v":"clear","w":"So"},{"p":"rain","v":"stop","w":"So"},{"p":"mud","v":"hide","w":"build"},{"p":"hall","v":"build","w":"build"},{"p":"airflow","v":"show","w":"air"},{"p":"printer","v":"dustBack","w":"build"}],"shots":[{"focus":["hall","puller"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"finish","shows":{"p":"lamp2","does":"ceiling lights hang over the machines and the pit water clears"},"do":[{"p":"airflow","v":"hide","w":"Add"},{"p":"lamp1","v":"show","w":"machines","autoW":{"w0":"lights"}},{"p":"lamp2","v":"show","w":"clear","autoW":{"w0":"lights"}},{"p":"lamp3","v":"show","w":"clear","autoW":{"w0":"lights"}},{"p":"hall","v":"lights","w":"lights"},{"p":"sandPit","v":"clear","w":"clear","o":-0.7}],"shots":[{"focus":["puller","lamp1","lamp2","lamp3"],"width":0.85}]},{"s":"congrats","do":[],"shots":[{"focus":"home"}]}],"audio":{"cards":[{"text":"2,000 °DEGREES","at":{"s":"fix2","w":"2,000"},"d":1.6},{"text":"20 BILLION","at":{"s":"fact","w":"20"},"d":1.6}],"sfx":[{"lib":"dirt","at":{"s":"hook","w":"dig"},"d":1.2},{"lib":"water_rush","at":{"s":"hook","w":"muddy"},"d":1.2},{"lib":"dirt","at":{"s":"fix1","w":"pour"},"d":1.2},{"lib":"flame","at":{"s":"fix2","w":"heat"},"d":1.4},{"lib":"motor_hum","at":{"s":"how","w":"print"},"d":1.4}],"chimes":[{"s":"fix2","w":"2,000"},{"s":"name"},{"s":"fact","w":"20"},{"s":"congrats"}],"rain":{"from":{"s":"problem3","w":"rain"},"to":{"s":"fix4","w":"So"},"underDb":24}},"codeShots":true,"why":"A chip factory grows out of a muddy pit on a plain lawn: the pit in section in front, where muddy water settles to sand, and a row of machines right behind it (an arc furnace with a carbon bin, a crystal puller, a light printer and a wafer rack), which a factory hall is built around at the end to make a cleanroom. The camera opens close on the pit, then frames each machine in mid shots as it is added, and ends on the lit hall with the clear pit in front.","hold":true},"sentences":[{"role":"hook","text":"If you dig a pit and let muddy water settle, you have a sandy floor."},{"role":"problem","text":"But sand is silicon locked to oxygen, so no current passes through it."},{"role":"stakes","text":"It is full of clay and iron, yet a chip allows only one foreign atom per billion."},{"role":"fix1","text":"So you pour the sand into a furnace with carbon."},{"role":"fix2","text":"Then you heat it to about 2,000 degrees Celsius, and the oxygen burns off as gas."},{"role":"fix3","text":"So you melt the pure silicon and pull one single crystal out of it."},{"role":"name","text":"This is a Czochralski crystal puller."},{"role":"name2","text":"Slice the crystal into thin discs, and each disc is a wafer."},{"role":"how","text":"Machines print layer after layer of tiny switches onto each wafer with light."},{"role":"fact","text":"One modern chip can hold over 20 billion of those switches."},{"role":"problem2","text":"But a single speck of dust landing on a wafer can kill the chip."},{"role":"problem3","text":"And out in the open, rain blows mud onto the machines and ruins a whole batch."},{"role":"fix4","text":"So you build a hall around the machines and push filtered air down, making a cleanroom."},{"role":"finish","text":"Add ceiling lights over the machines, and the pit water runs clear."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a semiconductor factory."}]}